-- the magnetic term on a charge network: a loop raises the integer flux label of each edge it runs along by its sign there (flux and loop as lists over the edges, entries integers); the U(1) loop operator of QSD V along the graph is this shift
dz-loop : List BZ → List BZ → List BZ
dz-loop ns ls = case ns of
  nil → nil
  cons n r → (case ls of
    nil → cons n r
    cons l s → cons (bz-add n l) (dz-loop r s))
